{"openapi":"3.0.3","info":{"title":"WWHN-195 Outbound Document API Contract","version":"1.0.0","description":"Chứng từ/chế độ/trạng thái xuất kho (BE1). Outbound document luôn sinh từ một outbound_request (toa xuất) đã OPEN — không nhận lines thủ công. Chế độ nhập tay/quét mã không phải một field enum tường minh: FE gửi item_id (nhập tay) hoặc code_value (quét mã/barcode/RFID) trong cùng payload /scan; server tự resolve item tương ứng. State machine dùng chung với inbound trên bảng stock_documents: DRAFT -> SCANNING -> POSTED, hoặc -> CANCELLED (terminal). Chỉ Post Issue mới thay đổi tồn kho (stock_effect=DECREASE); Scan/Unmatch stock_effect=NONE."},"servers":[{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:8000","description":"Local/CI; thay bằng environment URL đã duyệt."}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Outbound Document"},{"name":"Outbound Scan"},{"name":"Outbound Posting"},{"name":"Outbound Reversal"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT"}},"parameters":{"DocumentId":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},"IfMatch":{"name":"If-Match","in":"header","required":true,"description":"Version hiện tại của document (số nguyên, không phải ETag chuẩn RFC). Bắt buộc cho mọi mutation trên document đã tồn tại. Thiếu -> 428 PRECONDITION_REQUIRED; sai/khác version hiện tại -> 412 PRECONDITION_FAILED.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"1"}},"IdempotencyKeyRequired":{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"description":"Bắt buộc cho Post Issue/Reverse — key ổn định cho một hành động thay đổi tồn kho.","schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":100}}},"schemas":{"Error":{"type":"object","required":["success","error"],"properties":{"success":{"type":"boolean","enum":[false]},"message":{"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"object","required":["code"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string"},"details":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}}}}}},"StoreOutboundDocumentRequest":{"type":"object","required":["src_warehouse_id","outbound_request_id"],"description":"`lines` bị cấm tuyệt đối (BP-WMS-04/05) — mọi dòng được hydrate tự động từ outbound_request_lines của outbound_request_id.","properties":{"doc_no":{"type":"string","maxLength":80,"nullable":true},"doc_date":{"type":"string","format":"date","nullable":true},"src_warehouse_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"outbound_request_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"agency_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"recipient_name":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"nullable":true},"recipient_address":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"nullable":true},"note":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"nullable":true}}},"UpdateOutboundDocumentRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"doc_no":{"type":"string","maxLength":80},"doc_date":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"agency_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"recipient_name":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"nullable":true},"recipient_address":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"nullable":true},"note":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"nullable":true},"lines":{"type":"array","description":"Chỉ cho phép khi document KHÔNG sinh từ outbound_request (source_request_immutable nếu có).","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"product_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"qty_planned":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"note":{"type":"string","nullable":true}}}}}},"OutboundScanRequest":{"type":"object","required":["line_id"],"description":"Chế độ nhập tay: gửi `item_id`. Chế độ quét mã: gửi `code_value` (server tự resolve item qua physical_codes). Có thể gửi cả hai để server đối chiếu khớp nhau (mismatch -> 422 PHYSICAL_CODE_ITEM_MISMATCH).","properties":{"line_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"quantity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"qty":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Alias của quantity."},"item_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true,"description":"Chế độ nhập tay."},"code_value":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"nullable":true,"description":"Chế độ quét mã (barcode/QR/RFID)."},"container_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"printer_config_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true}}},"OutboundScanResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"document_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"line_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"sku_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"item_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"quantity":{"type":"integer"},"required_quantity":{"type":"integer"},"scanned_quantity":{"type":"integer"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["SCANNING"]},"stock_effect":{"type":"string","enum":["NONE"]},"movement_created":{"type":"boolean","enum":[false]},"version":{"type":"integer"},"label_snapshot_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"label_status":{"type":"string","enum":["PENDING_PRINT","PRINTED","PRINT_FAILED"],"nullable":true}}},"OutboundUnmatchRequest":{"type":"object","required":["outbound_item_match_id"],"properties":{"outbound_item_match_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"nullable":true}}},"OutboundCancelRequest":{"type":"object","required":["reason"],"properties":{"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000}}},"PostIssueResult":{"type":"object","properties":{"document_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["POSTED"]},"movement_ids":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},"stock_effect":{"type":"string","enum":["DECREASE"]},"version":{"type":"integer"}}},"ReverseOutboundRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"reversal_document_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true,"description":"Xác nhận pending return đã tạo trước đó."},"reason_code":{"type":"string","maxLength":80,"nullable":true},"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000,"description":"Bắt buộc nếu không gửi reversal_document_id."},"condition_status":{"type":"string","enum":["SELLABLE","DEFECTIVE","NON_SELLABLE"],"description":"Bắt buộc cho outbound reversal khi không gửi reversal_document_id."},"physical_return_confirmed":{"type":"boolean","description":"true để post ngay; false/omit -> DRAFT/PENDING_RETURN, stock_effect=NONE."},"lines":{"type":"array","description":"Bắt buộc nếu không gửi reversal_document_id. PRODUCT/serial-tracked line yêu cầu item_id + quantity=1.","items":{"type":"object","required":["movement_id","quantity"],"properties":{"movement_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"quantity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"item_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true}}}}}},"OutboundDocument":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"doc_type":{"type":"string","enum":["issue"]},"doc_no":{"type":"string"},"doc_date":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["DRAFT","SCANNING","POSTED","CANCELLED"]},"src_warehouse_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"outbound_request_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"agency_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"recipient_name":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"recipient_address":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"version":{"type":"integer"},"lines":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"line_no":{"type":"integer"},"product_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"outbound_request_line_id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","nullable":true},"qty_planned":{"type":"integer"},"qty_actual":{"type":"integer"},"scanned_qty":{"type":"integer"}}}}}}},"responses":{"Unauthenticated":{"description":"Chưa xác thực","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"Forbidden":{"description":"Không có permission `outbound.*` tương ứng","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"Conflict":{"description":"State/version/idempotency conflict","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"Validation":{"description":"Lỗi validate hoặc business rule","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"PreconditionRequired":{"description":"Thiếu header If-Match","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"paths":{"/api/v1/outbound-documents":{"get":{"operationId":"listOutboundDocuments","tags":["Outbound Document"],"summary":"Danh sách outbound document (label/RFID progress kèm theo)","x-permission":"outbound.view","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"}}},"post":{"operationId":"storeOutboundDocument","tags":["Outbound Document"],"summary":"Tạo outbound document từ toa xuất (BP-WMS-04/05)","x-permission":"outbound.create","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/StoreOutboundDocumentRequest"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Document DRAFT được tạo; ETag = version hiện tại","headers":{"ETag":{"schema":{"type":"string","example":"\"1\""}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundDocument"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"409":{"description":"OUTBOUND_REQUEST_ALREADY_USED — toa đã gắn document DRAFT/SCANNING/POSTED khác","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"lines bị cấm (prohibited) | OUTBOUND_REQUEST_NOT_ACTIVE | OUTBOUND_REQUEST_EMPTY | WAREHOUSE_NOT_ACTIVE | PRODUCT_SKU_REQUIRED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/outbound-documents/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"showOutboundDocument","tags":["Outbound Document"],"summary":"Chi tiết outbound document","x-permission":"outbound.view","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundDocument"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND"}}},"patch":{"operationId":"updateOutboundDocument","tags":["Outbound Document"],"summary":"Cập nhật outbound document (chỉ DRAFT/SCANNING)","x-permission":"outbound.create","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IfMatch"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UpdateOutboundDocumentRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","headers":{"ETag":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundDocument"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND"},"409":{"description":"STATE_CONFLICT | SOURCE_REQUEST_IMMUTABLE | SCANNED_DOCUMENT_IMMUTABLE | SCANNED_LINE_STRUCTURE_IMMUTABLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"412":{"description":"PRECONDITION_FAILED — version mismatch","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Validation"},"428":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PreconditionRequired"}}}},"/api/v1/outbound-documents/{id}/cancel":{"post":{"operationId":"cancelOutboundDocument","tags":["Outbound Document"],"summary":"Hủy outbound document (chỉ DRAFT/SCANNING; CANCELLED là terminal)","x-permission":"outbound.cancel","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IfMatch"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundCancelRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"CANCELLED. Nếu document gắn outbound_request và không còn phiếu active/POSTED nào khác dùng toa, toa tự trả về OPEN.","headers":{"ETag":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND"},"409":{"description":"STATE_CONFLICT","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"412":{"description":"PRECONDITION_FAILED"},"428":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PreconditionRequired"}}}},"/api/v1/outbound-documents/{id}/scan":{"post":{"operationId":"scanOutboundDocument","tags":["Outbound Scan"],"summary":"Match item vào dòng outbound — chế độ nhập tay (item_id) hoặc quét mã (code_value)","description":"stock_effect luôn NONE. Nếu item PRODUCT match thành công, server tự tạo label_snapshot và cố gắng dispatch in ngay (label_status trả kèm trong response; PRINT_FAILED không chặn scan, nhưng label PRINTED là điều kiện bắt buộc trước Post Issue).","x-permission":"outbound.scan","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IfMatch"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundScanRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","headers":{"ETag":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundScanResult"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND | DOCUMENT_LINE_NOT_FOUND"},"409":{"description":"STATE_CONFLICT | DUPLICATE_ITEM_IN_DOCUMENT | ITEM_ALREADY_MATCHED | DUPLICATE_ITEM_MATCH","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"412":{"description":"PRECONDITION_FAILED"},"422":{"description":"SCAN_EXCEEDS_REQUIRED | SKU_NOT_ACTIVE | PRODUCT_SKU_REQUIRED | ITEM_REQUIRED | SERIAL_QUANTITY_MUST_BE_ONE | INSUFFICIENT_STOCK | ITEM_NOT_AVAILABLE | PHYSICAL_CODE_NOT_FOUND | PHYSICAL_CODE_UNASSIGNED | PHYSICAL_CODE_ITEM_MISMATCH | ITEM_SKU_MISMATCH | OUTBOUND_REQUEST_REQUIRED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"428":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PreconditionRequired"}}}},"/api/v1/outbound-documents/{id}/unmatch":{"post":{"operationId":"unmatchOutboundItem","tags":["Outbound Scan"],"summary":"Gỡ item đã match trước Post (\"Gỡ trước Post\") — stock-neutral","x-permission":"outbound.scan","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IfMatch"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OutboundUnmatchRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Match chuyển ACTIVE -> REMOVED; item có thể scan lại vào phiếu này hoặc phiếu khác.","headers":{"ETag":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND | OUTBOUND_MATCH_NOT_FOUND"},"409":{"description":"STATE_CONFLICT | MATCH_NOT_ACTIVE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"412":{"description":"PRECONDITION_FAILED"},"428":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PreconditionRequired"}}}},"/api/v1/outbound-documents/{id}/post-issue":{"post":{"operationId":"postIssue","tags":["Outbound Posting"],"summary":"Post Issue atomically — full-post exact-match, thay đổi tồn kho đúng một lần","description":"Yêu cầu mọi dòng scanned_qty == qty_planned (FULL_POST_REQUIRED), mọi PRODUCT unit có item match ACTIVE (PRODUCT_ITEM_MATCH_REQUIRED) và label PRINTED (LABEL_NOT_PRINTED). Theo SRS v1.12 REQ-SRS-011 / DEC-RFID-FALLBACK-001, RFID là OPTIONAL — Post Issue KHÔNG gate theo RFID hardware_uid; gate ITEM_RFID_REQUIRED cũ đã bị gỡ khỏi baseline hiện hành. Idempotent theo Idempotency-Key; version bump và stock effect nằm trong cùng transaction.","x-permission":"outbound.post","x-stock-effect":"DECREASE","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IfMatch"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyRequired"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"POSTED — committed đúng một lần, hoặc response gốc được replay nguyên trạng","headers":{"ETag":{"schema":{"type":"string"}},"Idempotent-Replay":{"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["true","false"]}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PostIssueResult"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND"},"409":{"description":"STATE_CONFLICT (không phải SCANNING) | idempotency key dùng lại với payload khác","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"412":{"description":"PRECONDITION_FAILED"},"422":{"description":"FULL_POST_REQUIRED | OUTBOUND_REQUEST_REQUIRED | PRODUCT_ITEM_MATCH_REQUIRED | LABEL_NOT_PRINTED | INSUFFICIENT_STOCK | INSUFFICIENT_AVAILABLE_STOCK (RFID không phải gate — DEC-RFID-FALLBACK-001)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"428":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PreconditionRequired"}}}},"/api/v1/outbound-documents/{id}/reverse":{"post":{"operationId":"reverseOutbound","tags":["Outbound Reversal"],"summary":"Reversal có kiểm soát cho outbound đã POSTED — original document giữ nguyên POSTED","description":"Nếu physical_return_confirmed != true, reversal dừng ở DRAFT/PENDING_RETURN với stock_effect=NONE (chờ xác nhận hàng vật lý đã về kho); gửi lại với reversal_document_id + physical_return_confirmed=true để Post.","x-permission":"inventory.reversal.post","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DocumentId"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IfMatch"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyRequired"}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReverseOutboundRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Reversal command processed; original document remains POSTED"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthenticated"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND | REVERSAL_NOT_FOUND"},"409":{"description":"STATE_CONFLICT | ALREADY_FULLY_REVERSED | REVERSAL_DEPENDENCY_EXISTS | REVERSAL_CONCURRENT_CONFLICT","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"412":{"description":"PRECONDITION_FAILED"},"422":{"description":"REVERSAL_ITEM_REQUIRED | REVERSAL_QTY_EXCEEDED | INVALID_RETURN_CONDITION | RETURN_CONDITION_REQUIRED | ITEM_SKU_MISMATCH | ITEM_NOT_IN_ORIGINAL_TRANSACTION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"428":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PreconditionRequired"}}}}},"x-document-version":"1.0.0","x-contract-status":"PROPOSED","x-approval-status":"PENDING_BA_SIGN_OFF","x-note":"WWHN-195 gốc trên Jira trống nội dung tại thời điểm soạn tài liệu này (2026-08-15); tài liệu này được suy ra từ code baseline thực tế (routes/api.php, CurrentBaselineDocumentController, CurrentBaselineStockFlowController, CurrentBaselineStockService) đã verify bằng test HTTP end-to-end. Cần BA đối chiếu lại với Jira gốc trước khi coi là baseline chính thức."}